stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> none
  none --> held: Create demo hold
  none --> confirmed: Record demo confirmation
  held --> confirmed: Record demo confirmation (recheck passes)
  held --> released: expiry at clock instant, or release
  held --> cancelled: Record demo cancellation
  confirmed --> cancelled: Record demo cancellation
  confirmed --> confirmed: Commit demo change (atomic, new tables committed before old released)
  released --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of none
    Hold, confirmation and change need an approved proposal
    for the current record version, rechecked at commit.
    Cancel and release need a reason. Every action is
    idempotent per action key. No other transitions exist.
  end note
